{"version":1,"reference":{"kind":"artifact_content","namespace":"#3841","artifact_type":"_dh-work-item-head-v1","name":"head"},"owner_reference":"#3841","content":"{\"version\":1,\"issue_reference\":\"#3841\",\"parent_revision\":\"20a88ac5fbb940a9baeaf62d9ba769ad4bb042d9bc8372925eacc86cabb0df53\",\"root_revision\":\"20a88ac5fbb940a9baeaf62d9ba769ad4bb042d9bc8372925eacc86cabb0df53\",\"body\":\"<!-- backlog-metadata:\\npriority: \\ntype: Feature\\nstatus: closed\\nadded: \\n-->\\n\\n## Description\\n\\nTwo independent tests fail only during the parallel full suite and pass when rerun alone, showing shared-state interference between xdist workers.\\n\\n## Acceptance Criteria\\n\\n<div><sub>0000-00-00T00:00:00Z</sub>\\n\\n- Both tests use worker-local state or filter shared spies without assuming every call has one repository shape.\\n- Repeated `uv run pytest` runs pass under the configured `-n 2 --dist loadgroup`.\\n- Focused tests continue to pass independently.\\n</div>\\n\\n## Reproductions\\n\\n<div><sub>0000-00-00T00:00:00Z</sub>\\n\\n- `uv run pytest` run 1: `test_main_reports_match_and_exits_0` failed because `.tmp/scratch/reports/migration-fidelity-verification-20260924.md` disappeared before the assertion. The exact test passed alone.\\n- `uv run pytest` run 2: `test_git_common_root_closes_repo_object` observed another test's `Repo` object in its class-level `close` spy and accessed the wrong attribute. The exact test passed alone.\\n\\nEach full run otherwise reported 7,163 passed, 54 skipped, and 10 xfailed.\\n</div>\\n\",\"digest\":\"0673e936974a6296dbaaadc80f34d4995f7b99c68865579b877d86b11df00591\",\"comment_id\":\"IC_kwDOQGimCs8AAAABXCMivw\"}"}